<title>HONG KONG: Deutsche Bank sets call warrants on HSBC.</title>
<headline>Deutsche Bank sets call warrants on HSBC.</headline>
<dateline>HONG KONG 1997-01-30</dateline>
<text>
<p>Deutsche Bank AG, London</p>
<p>Branch, said on Thursday it intended to issue 38 million call</p>
<p>warrants on shares of HSBC Holdings Plc.</p>
<p>Ten warrants control one share.</p>
<p> STRIKE PRICE	HK$147	    PREMIUM	 6.85 PCT</p>
<p> ISSUE PRICE	 HK$3.99875	GEARING	 4.4x</p>
<p> EXPIRATION	  31.DEC.97	 MIN EXER LOT  4,000</p>
<p> LISTING	     HONG KONG	 PAY DATE	03.MAR.97</p>
<p> REFERENCE SPOT    HK$175	    LISTING DATE  05.MAR.97</p>
<p> NOTE		  PHYSICAL DELIVERY ONLY</p>
<p>-- Hong Kong Newsroom (852) 2843 6370</p>
</text>
